# UI Styling Guidelines

## Input Field Standards

### Text Color
- **Always use `text-gray-900`** for input field text
- **Never use white text** on white backgrounds
- **Consistent across all forms**: Lead info, address, measurements, specifications

### Input Field Classes
```typescript
// Standard input field styling
className="block w-full pl-10 pr-3 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent text-gray-900"

// With error state
className={`block w-full pl-10 pr-3 py-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent text-gray-900 ${
  errors.fieldName ? 'border-red-500' : 'border-gray-300'
}`}
```

### Select Dropdown Classes
```typescript
// Standard select styling
className="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent text-gray-900"
```

## Form Design Patterns

### Icon Integration
- **Leading Icons**: Use `absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3` positioning
- **Icon Colors**: `text-gray-400` for default state
- **Icon Sizes**: `h-5 w-5` for consistent sizing
- **Common Icons**:
  - `User` - Personal information
  - `Mail` - Email fields
  - `Phone` - Phone numbers
  - `MapPin` - Address/location
  - `Building2` - City/building
  - `Info` - Information fields

### Error Handling
```typescript
// Error display pattern
{errors.fieldName && (
  <p className="text-red-500 text-sm">{errors.fieldName}</p>
)}

// Error clearing on input
onChange={(e) => {
  handleInputChange('fieldName', e.target.value);
  if (errors.fieldName) {
    setErrors(prev => ({ ...prev, fieldName: '' }));
  }
}}
```

### Validation Patterns
```typescript
// Email validation
/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/

// Phone validation
/^[\+]?[1-9][\d]{0,15}$/

// Zip code validation
/^\d{5}(-\d{4})?$/

// Required field validation
if (!value?.trim()) {
  newErrors.fieldName = 'Field is required';
}
```

## Progress Indicators

### Step Progress
```typescript
// Two-step progress (Info/Address)
<div className="flex items-center justify-center space-x-4 mb-4">
  <div className="flex items-center">
    <div className="w-6 h-6 bg-green-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
      <div className="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full"></div>
    </div>
    <span className="ml-2 text-sm font-medium text-green-600">Info</span>
  </div>
  <div className="flex-1 h-px bg-gray-300"></div>
  <div className="flex items-center">
    <div className="w-6 h-6 bg-gray-300 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
      <div className="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full"></div>
    </div>
    <span className="ml-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Address</span>
  </div>
</div>
```

### Shape Progress
```typescript
// Multi-shape progress
<div className="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">
  <span>Shape {currentShapeIndex + 1} of {selectedShapes.length}</span>
  <span>{currentShape.layout.name}</span>
</div>
<div className="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2">
  <div 
    className="bg-blue-500 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300"
    style={{ width: `${((currentShapeIndex + 1) / selectedShapes.length) * 100}%` }}
  />
</div>
```

